name: sim.setProperty
description: Convenience function to set a property
luaSynopsis: sim.setProperty(int target, string propertyName, any propertyState, int propertyType = None)
pythonSynopsis: sim.setProperty(int target, string propertyName, any propertyState, int propertyType = nil)
inputs:
1. target: target item
2. propertyName: property name
3. propertyState: property value
4. propertyType: an optional property type
outputs:
